TSMC USB2.0 Design Reference Flow Example

1. There are separate README files in each sub-directories. Please read README
   file before you get start.
   
2. The library name in this example may not correspond to the released library.
   Please check and modify to the version you adopted before you get start.
   
3. All the design kits in "LIB" directory are removed. Please get necessary
   files according to the scripts in every directory.
   
4. This design reference flow is a simple example. Customers should complete
   their own constraints for particular design.
    
